{"type":"message","id":"133764ba","parentId":"8bdf096a","timestamp":"2026-02-18T15:57:41.729Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the directory was created. Now I need to create the slidegen.js file. This file should be a Node.js script that generates a slide deck about OpenClaw Features. Since the user specifically mentioned that the tool might need Node.js dependencies, I'll create a simple but effective slide generator using HTML/CSS/JS with reveal.js, and use puppeteer to convert to PDF.\n\nFirst, let me create the slidegen.js file. I'll need to:\n1. Define the slide content (5 slides about OpenClaw Features)\n2. Generate an HTML file with reveal.js\n3. Use puppeteer to open the HTML and save as PDF\n\nI'll also need a package.json to specify dependencies.\n\nLet me create these files:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the slidegen.js file with a Node.js tool that generates vibrant slides using reveal.js and exports to PDF:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_40e26e1281774484b5da8d55","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social\\AgentHr\\slide-gen\\slidegen.js","content":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst puppeteer = require('puppeteer');\n\nconst slides = [\n  {\n    title: \"OpenClaw Features\",\n    subtitle: \"A Powerful Multi-Platform Assistant\",\n    background: \"linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%)\",\n    content: `\n      <h2 style=\"color: white; font-size: 3em;\">OpenClaw</h2>\n      <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 1.5em;\">The Next Generation Personal Assistant Platform</p>\n      <ul style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.2em; margin-top: 2em;\">\n        <li>Multi-platform support</li>\n        <li>Extensible architecture</li>\n        <li>Vibrant UI</li>\n        <li>Seamless integrations</li>\n      </ul>\n    `\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Multi-Platform Support\",\n    background: \"linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%)\",\n    content: `\n      <h2 style=\"color: white;\">Connect Anywhere</h2>\n      <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 30px;\">\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"color: white;\">💬 Discord</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: white;\">Full chat and group support</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"color: white;\">📱 WhatsApp</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: white;\">Messaging and media</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"color: white;\">🔧 CLI</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: white;\">Command-line interface</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"color: white;\">🌐 Web</h3>\n          <p style=\"color: white;\">Browser automation</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Smart Tooling\",\n    background: \"linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%)\",\n    content: `\n      <h2 style=\"color: white;\">Powerful Toolset</h2>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: 30px; justify-content: center;\">\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0., padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          📄 File Operations\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          🌐 Web Searches\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          🤖 AI Integration\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          📊 Canvas Rendering\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          🎨 Browser Control\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n          🔊 TTS/Speech\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Extensible Architecture\",\n    background: \"linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b 0%, #38f9d7 100%)\",\n    content: `\n      <h2 style=\"color: white;\">Built for Growth</h2>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: white; margin-bottom: 20px;\">🔌 Plugin System</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.2em;\">Add new capabilities without modifying core</p>\n\n        <h3 style=\"color: white; margin: 30px 0 20px;\">🔄 Sub-Agent Orchestration</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.2em;\">Spawn and manage specialized agents</p>\n\n        <h3 style=\"color: white; margin: 30px 0 20px;\">📝 Memory Management</h3>\n        <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.2em;\">Structured long-term and daily notes</p>\n      </div>\n    `\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Get Started Today\",\n    background: \"linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%)\",\n    content: `\n      <h2 style=\"color: white; text-align: center;\">Ready to Explore?</h2>\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;\">\n        <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding: 30px; border-radius: 15px; display: inline-block;\">\n          <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.3em; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            OpenClaw combines power with simplicity\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.1em;\">\n            Documentation • Examples • Community\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: white; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-style: italic;\">\n        Built with ❤️ for productivity\n      </p>\n    `\n  }\n];\n\nasync function generateSlides() {\n  console.log('Starting slide generation...');\n\n  const html = `\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>OpenClaw Features</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/reveal.js/4.5.0/reveal.min.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/reveal.js/4.5.0/theme/black.min.css\">\n  <style>\n    body { margin: 0; }\n    .reveal { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }\n    .reveal h2 { font-size: 2.5em; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }\n    .reveal ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }\n    .reveal ul li { margin: 15px 0; padding-left: 20px; position: relative; }\n    .reveal ul li:before { content: \"▸\"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }\n    .reveal h3 { font-size: 1.8em; }\n    .reveal p { line-height: 1.6; }\n    .slides section { text-align: left; padding: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }\n    .slides section.center { text-align: center; justify-content: center; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"reveal\">\n    <div class=\"slides\">\n      ${slides.map((slide, index) => `\n        <section class=\"${index === 4 ? 'center' : ''}\" style=\"background: ${slide.background}; color: white;\">\n          ${slide.content}\n        </section>\n      `).join('\\n')}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/reveal.js/4.5.0/reveal.min.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    Reveal.initialize({\n      hash: false,\n      slideNumber: false,\n      transition: 'slide'\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n  `;\n\n  const tempHtmlPath = path.join(__dirname, 'temp-slides.html');\n  fs.writeFileSync(tempHtmlPath, html);\n  console.log('HTML slides created');\n\n  const browser = await puppeteer.launch({\n    headless: 'new',\n    args: ['--no-sandbox', '--disable-setuid-sandbox']\n  });\n\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  await page.setContent(html, { waitUntil: 'networkidle0' });\n\n  const outputPath = path.join(__dirname, 'demo-slides.pdf');\n  await page.pdf({\n    path: outputPath,\n    format: 'A4',\n    printBackground: true,\n    margin: {\n      top: '0',\n      bottom: '0',\n      left: '0',\n      right: '0'\n    }\n  });\n\n  await browser.close();\n  fs.unlinkSync(tempHtmlPath);\n\n  console.log(`✅ Slides generated successfully: ${outputPath}`);\n  return outputPath;\n}\n\ngenerateSlides().catch(console.error);"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":10745,"output":2671,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13416,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771430246343}}
