{"type":"message","id":"eeb5a779","parentId":"cff65567","timestamp":"2026-02-18T16:05:37.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now I need to rewrite slidegen.js to use pdf-lib to generate the slides as PDF pages with vibrant backgrounds and text.\n\npdf-lib is a pure JavaScript library for creating and editing PDFs. It doesn't require any native binaries, just npm install. I can draw rectangles with colors and add text. This should be much lighter.\n\nI'll rewrite slidegen.js:\n\n- Define slides with background colors (I'll use hex colors) and content (title, bullet lists, etc.)\n- Create a PDF document with one page per slide (A4 size: 595x842 points)\n- For each slide:\n  - Draw a rectangle covering the whole page with the background color\n  - Add title and content text with appropriate fonts and colors\n  - Use embedded default font (pdf-lib has a standard font)\n- Save to demo-slides.pdf\n\nI need to be careful with text layout: pdf-lib's text wrapping is manual. I'll try to keep text simple or implement simple word wrap. To keep it simple, I'll limit content to a few lines and manually position them. But the content can be more than one line. I'll implement basic word wrap.\n\nLet's write the new slidegen.js.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll rewrite slidegen.js to use pdf-lib:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3d040668701048fa907c33df","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social\\AgentHr\\slide-gen\\slidegen.js","content":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst { PDFDocument, rgb, StandardFonts } = require('pdf-lib');\n\n// Slide definitions with background colors and content\nconst slides = [\n  {\n    title: \"OpenClaw Features\",\n    subtitle: \"A Powerful Multi-Platform Assistant\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.4, g: 0.5, b: 0.92 }, // bluish purple\n    content: [\n      { text: \"OpenClaw\", size: 48, y: 350, color: 'white', center: true },\n      { text: \"The Next Generation Personal Assistant Platform\", size: 24, y: 410, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)', center: true },\n      { text: \"• Multi-platform support\", size: 20, y: 500, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"• Extensible architecture\", size: 20, y: 530, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"• Vibrant UI\", size: 20, y: 560, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"• Seamless integrations\", size: 20, y: 590, color: 'white' }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Multi-Platform Support\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.94, g: 0.58, b: 0.8 }, // pinkish\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Connect Anywhere\", size: 42, y: 180, color: 'white', center: true },\n      // Row 1\n      { text: \"💬 Discord\", size: 26, x: 100, y: 320, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"Full chat and group support\", size: 18, x: 100, y: 350, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)' },\n      { text: \"📱 WhatsApp\", size: 26, x: 350, y: 320, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"Messaging and media\", size: 18, x: 350, y: 350, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)' },\n      // Row 2\n      { text: \"🔧 CLI\", size: 26, x: 100, y: 440, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"Command-line interface\", size: 18, x: 100, y: 470, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)' },\n      { text: \"🌐 Web\", size: 26, x: 350, y: 440, color: 'white' },\n      { text: \"Browser automation\", size: 18, x: 350, y: 470, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)' }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Smart Tooling\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.31, g: 0.67, b: 1.0 }, // bright blue\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Powerful Toolset\", size: 42, y: 180, color: 'white', center: true },\n      // Pills 1st row\n      { text: \"📄 File Operations\", size: 22, x: 80, y: 280, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 },\n      { text: \"🌐 Web Searches\", size: 22, x: 300, y: 280, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 },\n      { text: \"🤖 AI Integration\", size: 22, x: 520, y: 280, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 },\n      // Row 2\n      { text: \"📊 Canvas Rendering\", size: 22, x: 190, y: 360, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 },\n      { text: \"🎨 Browser Control\", size: 22, x: 410, y: 360, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 },\n      // Row 3\n      { text: \"🔊 TTS/Speech\", size: 22, x: 300, y: 440, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.2, g: 0.4, b: 0.8, a: 0.3 }, pad: 10 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Extensible Architecture\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.26, g: 0.88, b: 0.69 }, // greenish\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Built for Growth\", size: 42, y: 180, color: 'black', center: true },\n      { text: \"🔌 Plugin System\", size: 28, y: 280, color: 'black' },\n      { text: \"Add new capabilities without modifying core\", size: 20, y: 320, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.7)' },\n      { text: \"🔄 Sub-Agent Orchestration\", size: 28, y: 400, color: 'black' },\n      { text: \"Spawn and manage specialized agents\", size: 20, y: 440, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.7)' },\n      { text: \"📝 Memory Management\", size: 28, y: 520, color: 'black' },\n      { text: \"Structured long-term and daily notes\", size: 20, y: 560, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.7)' }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Get Started Today\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.98, g: 0.44, b: 0.6 }, // coral\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Ready to Explore?\", size: 48, y: 200, color: 'white', center: true },\n      { text: \"OpenClaw combines power with simplicity\", size: 26, y: 400, color: 'white', center: true },\n      { text: \"Documentation • Examples • Community\", size: 22, y: 450, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)', center: true },\n      { text: \"Built with ❤️ for productivity\", size: 20, y: 700, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)', center: true }\n    ]\n  }\n];\n\nasync function generateSlides() {\n  console.log('Generating slides...');\n\n  const pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\n  const pageWidth = 595.28; // A4 width in points\n  const pageHeight = 841.89; // A4 height in points\n\n  // Load a standard font\n  const font = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\n  const boldFont = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.HelveticaBold);\n\n  slides.forEach((slide, index) => {\n    const page = pdfDoc.addPage([pageWidth, pageHeight]);\n    const { width, height } = page.getSize();\n\n    // Draw background\n    page.drawRectangle({\n      x: 0,\n      y: 0,\n      width,\n      height,\n      color: rgb(slide.bgColor.r, slide.bgColor.g, slide.bgColor.b)\n    });\n\n    // Draw content items\n    slide.content.forEach(item => {\n      let textFont = (item.bold === false) ? font : boldFont;\n      if (item.font === 'regular') textFont = font;\n      if (item.font === 'bold') textFont = boldFont;\n\n      const textSize = item.size || 24;\n      const textColor = item.color === 'white' ? rgb(1, 1, 1) : item.color === 'black' ? rgb(0, 0, 0) : rgb(0.5, 0.5, 0.5);\n      // Actually parse color properly if hex or rgba string. Simplify: assume white/black/gray.\n      let color;\n      if (item.color === 'white') color = rgb(1, 1, 1);\n      else if (item.color === 'black') color = rgb(0, 0, 0);\n      else if (item.color.startsWith('rgba')) {\n        const match = item.color.match(/rgba?\\((\\d+),\\s*(\\d+),\\s*(\\d+)/);\n        if (match) {\n          color = rgb(parseInt(match[1])/255, parseInt(match[2])/255, parseInt(match[3])/255);\n        } else {\n          color = rgb(0.5, 0.5, 0.5);\n        }\n      } else {\n        color = rgb(0, 0, 0);\n      }\n\n      // Draw optional background pill\n      if (item.bg) {\n        const textWidth = textFont.widthOfTextAtSize(item.text, textSize);\n        const pad = item.pad || 8;\n        page.drawRectangle({\n          x: item.x - pad,\n          y: item.y - textSize + 4,\n          width: textWidth + pad * 2,\n          height: textSize + 10,\n          color: rgb(item.bg.r, item.bg.g, item.bg.b, item.bg.a || 0.3)\n        });\n      }\n\n      page.drawText(item.text, {\n        x: item.center !== true ? item.x || 50 : width / 2,\n        y: item.y,\n        size: textSize,\n        font: textFont,\n        color,\n        rotate: { type: 'degrees', angle: 0 },\n        align: item.center === true ? 'center' : 'left'\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Title slide special: add title centered if not already in content\n    if (slide.title && !slide.content.some(c => c.text === slide.title)) {\n      page.drawText(slide.title, {\n        x: width / 2,\n        y: height - 100,\n        size: 36,\n        font: boldFont,\n        color: rgb(1, 1, 1),\n        align: 'center'\n      });\n    }\n  });\n\n  const pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n  const outputPath = path.join(__dirname, 'demo-slides.pdf');\n  fs.writeFileSync(outputPath, pdfBytes);\n  console.log(`✅ Slides generated: ${outputPath}`);\n}\n\ngenerateSlides().catch(err => {\n  console.error('Error:', err);\n  process.exit(1);\n});"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":27172,"output":3122,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771430713766}}
