{"type":"message","id":"aa5fdc2d","parentId":"f10ef865","timestamp":"2026-02-18T16:06:24.194Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error: \"WinAnsi cannot encode \\\"\\\" (0x1f4ac)\". This is because the standard fonts in pdf-lib (Helvetica) only support WinAnsi encoding, which doesn't include many Unicode emoji characters. The slide content includes emojis like 💬, 📱, 🔧, 🌐, 🤖, 📊, 🎨, 🔊, 🔌, 🔄, 📝, ❤️. These cannot be rendered with the standard fonts.\n\nI need to either:\n1. Remove emojis and replace with plain text (e.g., \"Discord\" instead of \"💬 Discord\")\n2. Or embed a custom font that supports these emojis (like Noto Color Emoji). That would be more complex and increase font size.\n\nGiven simplicity, I'll replace emojis with simple icons (maybe use asterisks or skip them). Or I could use ASCII-like symbols that are in WinAnsi, like basic punctuation. Actually many common symbols are available, but not the emoji range. Let me check which emojis are causing issues: \"\" is the representation of the emoji? That's weird; it's showing a private use area character. But anyway, emojis are not supported.\n\nSimplify: replace emojis with plain text descriptors or simple symbols like [D] etc. But the task says \"vibrant slides\", maybe emojis are not essential. I can remove them or replace with simple text like \"Discord\", \"WhatsApp\", etc.\n\nI'll modify the slides to remove emojis entirely and rely on colors and bold text.\n\nLet me update the slidegen.js content to not include emojis. Also ensure any special characters that might be problematic are avoided.\n\nI'll rewrite the slides content without emojis. I'll also adjust colors for contrast.\n\nLet me create an updated version:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"The standard fonts don't support emojis. Let me update the slides to remove emojis and use plain text with vibrant colors:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8f91bc91761c49a1821fd09c","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social\\AgentHr\\slide-gen\\slidegen.js","content":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst { PDFDocument, rgb, StandardFonts } = require('pdf-lib');\n\n// Slide definitions with background colors and content\nconst slides = [\n  {\n    title: \"OpenClaw Features\",\n    subtitle: \"A Powerful Multi-Platform Assistant\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.4, g: 0.5, b: 0.92 }, // bluish purple\n    content: [\n      { text: \"OpenClaw\", size: 52, y: 350, color: 'white', center: true, bold: true },\n      { text: \"The Next Generation Personal Assistant Platform\", size: 24, y: 420, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.95)', center: true },\n      { text: \"Multi-platform support\", size: 22, y: 500, color: 'white', x: 150 },\n      { text: \"Extensible architecture\", size: 22, y: 540, color: 'white', x: 150 },\n      { text: \"Vibrant UI\", size: 22, y: 580, color: 'white', x: 150 },\n      { text: \"Seamless integrations\", size: 22, y: 620, color: 'white', x: 150 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Multi-Platform Support\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.94, g: 0.58, b: 0.8 }, // pinkish\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Connect Anywhere\", size: 46, y: 180, color: 'white', center: true, bold: true },\n      // Row 1\n      { text: \"Discord\", size: 28, x: 90, y: 290, color: 'white', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Full chat and group support\", size: 18, x: 90, y: 320, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.95)' },\n      { text: \"WhatsApp\", size: 28, x: 380, y: 290, color: 'white', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Messaging and media\", size: 18, x: 380, y: 320, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.95)' },\n      // Row 2\n      { text: \"CLI\", size: 28, x: 90, y: 420, color: 'white', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Command-line interface\", size: 18, x: 90, y: 450, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.95)' },\n      { text: \"Web\", size: 28, x: 380, y: 420, color: 'white', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Browser automation\", size: 18, x: 380, y: 450, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.95)' }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Smart Tooling\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.31, g: 0.67, b: 1.0 }, // bright blue\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Powerful Toolset\", size: 46, y: 180, color: 'white', center: true, bold: true },\n      // Pills 1st row\n      { text: \"File Operations\", size: 22, x: 60, y: 300, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true },\n      { text: \"Web Searches\", size: 22, x: 330, y: 300, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true },\n      // Row 2\n      { text: \"AI Integration\", size: 22, x: 195, y: 380, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true },\n      { text: \"Canvas Rendering\", size: 22, x: 60, y: 460, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true },\n      // Row 3\n      { text: \"Browser Control\", size: 22, x: 330, y: 460, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true },\n      { text: \"TTS/Speech\", size: 22, x: 195, y: 540, color: 'white', bg: { r: 0.1, g: 0.3, b: 0.7, a: 0.4 }, pad: 12, radius: 20, pill: true }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Extensible Architecture\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.26, g: 0.88, b: 0.69 }, // greenish\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Built for Growth\", size: 46, y: 180, color: 'black', center: true, bold: true },\n      { text: \"Plugin System\", size: 30, y: 290, color: 'black', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Add new capabilities without modifying core\", size: 20, y: 330, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.75)' },\n      { text: \"Sub-Agent Orchestration\", size: 30, y: 410, color: 'black', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Spawn and manage specialized agents\", size: 20, y: 450, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.75)' },\n      { text: \"Memory Management\", size: 30, y: 530, color: 'black', bold: true },\n      { text: \"Structured long-term and daily notes\", size: 20, y: 570, color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.75)' }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: \"Get Started Today\",\n    bgColor: { r: 0.98, g: 0.44, b: 0.6 }, // coral\n    content: [\n      { text: \"Ready to Explore?\", size: 52, y: 250, color: 'white', center: true, bold: true },\n      { text: \"OpenClaw combines power with simplicity\", size: 26, y: 400, color: 'white', center: true },\n      { text: \"Documentation - Examples - Community\", size: 22, y: 460, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.9)', center: true },\n      { text: \"Built with love for productivity\", size: 22, y: 720, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)', center: true }\n    ]\n  }\n];\n\nfunction parseColor(colorStr) {\n  if (colorStr === 'white') return rgb(1, 1, 1);\n  if (colorStr === 'black') return rgb(0, 0, 0);\n  const match = colorStr.match(/rgba?\\((\\d+),\\s*(\\d+),\\s*(\\d+)/);\n  if (match) {\n    return rgb(parseInt(match[1]) / 255, parseInt(match[2]) / 255, parseInt(match[3]) / 255);\n  }\n  return rgb(0, 0, 0);\n}\n\nasync function generateSlides() {\n  console.log('Generating slides...');\n  const pdfDoc = await PDFDocument.create();\n  const pageWidth = 595.28; // A4 width in points\n  const pageHeight = 841.89; // A4 height in points\n  const font = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.Helvetica);\n  const boldFont = await pdfDoc.embedFont(StandardFonts.HelveticaBold);\n\n  slides.forEach((slide) => {\n    const page = pdfDoc.addPage([pageWidth, pageHeight]);\n    // Background\n    page.drawRectangle({\n      x: 0, y: 0, width: pageWidth, height: pageHeight,\n      color: rgb(slide.bgColor.r, slide.bgColor.g, slide.bgColor.b)\n    });\n\n    slide.content.forEach(item => {\n      const textFont = item.bold ? boldFont : font;\n      const color = parseColor(item.color);\n      if (item.pill && item.bg) {\n        const textWidth = textFont.widthOfTextAtSize(item.text, item.size);\n        const pad = item.pad || 8;\n        page.drawRectangle({\n          x: item.x - pad,\n          y: item.y - item.size + 4,\n          width: textWidth + pad * 2,\n          height: item.size + 12,\n          color: rgb(item.bg.r, item.bg.g, item.bg.b, item.bg.a !== undefined ? item.bg.a : 0.4),\n          // If radius support added later\n        });\n      }\n      page.drawText(item.text, {\n        x: item.center ? pageWidth / 2 : item.x,\n        y: item.y,\n        size: item.size,\n        font: textFont,\n        color,\n        align: item.center ? 'center' : 'left'\n      });\n    });\n  });\n\n  const pdfBytes = await pdfDoc.save();\n  const outputPath = path.join(__dirname, 'demo-slides.pdf');\n  fs.writeFileSync(outputPath, pdfBytes);\n  console.log(`✅ Slides generated: ${outputPath}`);\n}\n\ngenerateSlides().catch(err => {\n  console.error('Error:', err);\n  process.exit(1);\n});"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":31432,"output":3223,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34655,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771430763510}}
